{"steam_appid":1729180,"steam_name":"Last Vanguard","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1729180/2038917973/a1b247fcce23332502fa9b44c06fcc343d79877e/1751024774/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1747331682","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257138800/3d052ec0c4f6262a2666ba1d0aa502f352181774/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747331682","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729180/ss_8d8a6ed3c79647e762da08bb306f6eaa16101e02.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760121647","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729180/ss_ba783b66cebf3739efe861b0bebc05865b1312aa.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760121647","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729180/ss_997fab7525692a46c36258b7098b29ab194259c1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760121647","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729180/ss_b313ce9dba7e40df1a84febdb8feda649c56eff7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760121647","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729180/ss_341ff576bac2e7c680a869b9a2874e5fd94c5205.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760121647"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last Vanguard</strong> is a <strong>Metroidvania shooter-platformer</strong> with <strong>RPG elements</strong> and <strong>hand-drawn, frame-by-frame animations</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729180/extras/9327aeeb813f5649f817344e30a1e140.poster.avif?t=1760121647\" width=616 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729180/extras/9327aeeb813f5649f817344e30a1e140.webm?t=1760121647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729180/extras/9327aeeb813f5649f817344e30a1e140.mp4?t=1760121647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729180/extras/941564fa990786036854680631ee7238.webp?t=1760121647\" width=616 height=49 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore an epic world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>Explore with freedom</strong> a <strong>stunning hand-crafted world</strong> ravaged by war and ruled by an <strong>evil tyrant</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Face a wide variety of enemies</strong> as you <strong>customize your strategy</strong>, <strong>switch weapons</strong>, and <strong>unlock active and passive abilities</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤝 <strong>Form unexpected alliances</strong> and <strong>discover breathtaking locations</strong> amidst the desolation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729180/extras/25ab940538c09453d6242e6777413635.poster.avif?t=1760121647\" width=616 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729180/extras/25ab940538c09453d6242e6777413635.webm?t=1760121647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729180/extras/25ab940538c09453d6242e6777413635.mp4?t=1760121647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729180/extras/941564fa990786036854680631ee7238.webp?t=1760121647\" width=616 height=49 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💀 <strong>28 boss battles</strong> featuring unique <strong>hand-drawn animations</strong> and <strong>varied combat styles</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌎 <strong>9 handcrafted biomes</strong>, each with its own <strong>enemies</strong> and <strong>gameplay mechanics</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔫 <strong>15 types of weapons</strong>, each affecting your <strong>combat style</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ A wide range of <strong>active and passive abilities</strong>, along with different 🪖 <strong>helmets</strong> to personalize your experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <strong>Make your own strategy</strong> by <strong>customizing your equipment</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729180/extras/62e68effaa32fe86009fdaf0a3a48edf.poster.avif?t=1760121647\" width=616 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729180/extras/62e68effaa32fe86009fdaf0a3a48edf.webm?t=1760121647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1729180/extras/62e68effaa32fe86009fdaf0a3a48edf.mp4?t=1760121647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 9800GTX 1 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 560<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["Cool Tapir Studios"],"publishers":["Cool Tapir Studios"],"release_date":"15 May, 2025"}